      centrally in run-if-granted; kototama uses in-band -1 sentinels for
      quota/http plus denied! exceptions for structural violations; kotoba uses
      its own capability-granted? denial pattern"
     "fuel-exceeded ex-data vocabulary differs per repo (deliberately, per
      ADR-2607022700 authority separation): :aiueos.execute/fuel-exceeded vs
      :kototama.tender/problem :fuel-exhausted vs :kotoba.wasm/problem
